    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/builder-and-developer/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Builder and Developer theme is a modern, responsive, and professional solution designed for businesses in the construction, real estate, architecture, property development, and building services industries, making it highly suitable for contractor layout needs, home builder sites, civil engineering templates, renovation experts, interior design layouts, handyman business pages, real estate templates, architecture templates, house construction services, building company portfolios, and developer layouts. Whether you are a contractor, home builder, civil engineer, interior designer, renovation expert, or real estate developer, this theme provides a clean and structured layout to showcase projects, highlight services, and build trust with potential clients. Featuring a project showcase section, service listings, portfolio display, and client testimonials, it helps convert visitors into customers while supporting construction project galleries, property listings, and contact form plugins for seamless client communication. Integrated with a powerful page builder plugin such as SiteOrigin Page Builder for easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography, it allows you to design your site effortlessly without coding. A built-in blog enables you to share industry updates, construction tips, and real estate news, enhancing your brand credibility. Optimized for SEO, mobile responsiveness, and fast performance, the Builder and Developer theme is ideal for construction companies, property developers, and architectural firms seeking a strong online presence and better lead generation."
    },
